  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，我叫守戶，\n是密阿雷守護協會的會長。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C621153EB5B886236FF0C000A662F5BC6963F96F75B888B7753546703768467039577300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "之前我跑去圍堵闊星的總裁，\n實在是太小家子氣了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4B524D62118DD153BB570D583595CA661F76847E3D88C1FF0C000A5BE65728662F592A5C0F5BB65B506C234E86300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請讓我在此道歉！\n那時真的是非常抱歉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB8B93621157286B6490536B49FF01000A90A36642771F7684662F975E5E3862B16B49300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟是密阿雷守護協會的會長，\n我也是會像現在這樣彬彬有禮的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF662F5BC6963F96F75B888B7753546703768467039577FF0C000A62114E5F662F670350CF73FE572890196A235F6C5F6C670979AE7684300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而說到密阿雷守護協會的正義，\n那就是守護密阿雷的市民免於不安！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C8AAA52305BC6963F96F75B888B775354670376846B637FA9FF0C000A90A35C31662F5B888B775BC6963F96F776845E026C11514D65BC4E0D5B89FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近有個受歡迎的影片頻道\n叫做靈異迷頻道。正如其名，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n播放的都是些靈異題材。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67008FD16709500B53D76B618FCE76845F717247983B9053000A53EB505A974875708FF7983B905330026B6359825176540DFF0C00100001BE00000A64AD653E768490FD662F4E9B97487570984C6750300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但也有些密阿雷市民因為\n這個頻道的內容而感到不安！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F464E5F67094E9B5BC6963F96F75E026C1156E070BA000A9019500B983B9053768451675BB9800C611F52304E0D5B89FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳聽到北側大道的大樓\n會出現女幽靈，不覺得很恐怖嗎！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3807D52305317507459279053768459276A13000A670351FA73FE59735E7D9748FF0C4E0D89BA5F975F886050601655CEFF01FF1F00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以要是那個頻道上傳的都是些\n無憑無據的謠言，那我得去跟營運投訴！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58981662F90A3500B983B90534E0A50B3768490FD662F4E9B000A71216191712164DA76848B208A00FF0C90A362115F9753BB8DDF71DF904B62958A34FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，我想找<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳\n確認一下靈異迷頻道上傳的東西<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n是不是真有其事！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C621160F3627E001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B3000A78BA8A8D4E004E0B974875708FF7983B90534E0A50B376846771897F00100001BE00000A662F4E0D662F771F670951764E8BFF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喏！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看看這個影片的\n這段發言。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "558FFF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B770B9019500B5F7172477684000A90196BB5767C8A00300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "光盈世界，巨影之端\n疊於紅白彩繪之圓時，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n孩童亡靈將悄至\n拳搥大地者之身後。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……信不信由您。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "514976C84E16754CFF0C5DE85F714E4B7AEF000A758A65BC7D05767D5F697E6A4E4B57136642FF0C00100001BE01000A5B697AE54EA197485C07608481F3000A62F364255927573080054E4B8EAB5F8C300200100001BE01000A202620264FE14E0D4FE1753160A8300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這到底是故弄玄虛想增加點閱率，\n還是真的有這麼一回事……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的話，一定能弄清楚的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901952305E95662F65455F047384865B60F3589E52A09EDE95B17387FF0C000A9084662F771F7684670990199EBC4E0056DE4E8B2026202600100001BE00000A662F001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B376848A71FF0C4E005B9A80FD5F046E05695A7684300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳調查一下\n這篇投稿的內容到底是不是真的。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n光盈世界，巨影之端\n疊於紅白彩繪之圓時，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n孩童亡靈將悄至\n拳搥大地者之身後。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都市傳說中指出的地點\n似乎就是這裡沒錯。但……？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD5E0250B38AAA4E2D630751FA768457309EDE000A4F3C4E4E5C31662F901988E16C92932F30024F4620262026FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "塔的影子正落在\n都市傳說所指的位置。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "585476845F715B506B63843D5728000A90FD5E0250B38AAA6240630776844F4D7F6E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要把拳頭搥向大地嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981628A62F3982D642554115927573055CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "搥下去！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64254E0B53BBFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要和<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一起確認\n影片上傳的內容到底是真是假。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981548C00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E008D7778BA8A8D000A5F7172474E0A50B3768451675BB952305E95662F771F662F5047300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小孩的亡靈！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F5B6976844EA19748FF01FF1F00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們得把那東西捉起來，\n好確認影片的內容是不是真的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150115F97628A90A36771897F63498D774F86FF0C000A597D78BA8A8D5F717247768451675BB9662F4E0D662F771F7684FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂喂喂！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳得捉住那東西啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "558255825582FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35F9763494F4F90A36771897F554AFF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來如此，原來如此。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8659826B64FF0C539F4F8659826B64300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "靈異迷頻道上說的，\n原來是這麼一回事啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "974875708FF7983B90534E0A8AAA7684FF0C000A539F4F86662F90199EBC4E0056DE4E8B554A300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是說，那是個向大眾傳達\n真實資訊的影片頻道囉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8AAAFF0C90A3662F500B54115927773E50B39054000A771F5BE68CC78A0A76845F717247983B905356C9300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我就去向營運團隊報告一聲，\n讓他們知道這不是個散佈謠言的頻道吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C62115C3153BB541171DF904B5718968A5831544A4E008072FF0C000A8B934ED6501177E5905390194E0D662F500B65634F488B208A007684983B90535427300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這次辛苦<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B218F9B82E600100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86300200100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但這麼說起來……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690199EBC8AAA8D774F862026202600100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "北側大道的大樓\n是真的會出現女幽靈！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5317507459279053768459276A13000A662F771F7684670351FA73FE59735E7D9748FF01FF1F00100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "從塔守護了密阿雷的<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n隨時可以成為密阿雷守護協會的會員！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9E58545B888B774E865BC6963F96F7768400100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A96A8664253EF4EE5621070BA5BC6963F96F75B888B77535467037684670354E1FF0100100002011401EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    }
